cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its data outputs, please cite it as below.
  For data, cite the specific release you used (each major release has a Zenodo DOI).
type: software
title: "bogota-pop: open population estimates for Bogotá D.C."
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible model that estimates resident population for every
  cadastral lot in Bogotá D.C., refreshed once per cadastral vigencia and
  published at block (manzana) and H3 level. It combines the CNPV 2018 census,
  UAECD cadastre and DANE–SDP post-COVID population projections. Code is MIT
  licensed; data outputs are CC BY 4.0.
authors:
  - family-names: Maya
    given-names: Gregorio
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-8285-7253"
version: 0.0.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gregmaya/bogota-pop"
keywords:
  - population
  - dasymetric mapping
  - areal interpolation
  - census
  - cadastre
  - Bogotá
  - Colombia
  - H3
